   },
   {
    "title": "步骤2",
    "body": "令 \\(b_k=(-1)^{k-1}a_ka_{k+1}=8(-4)^{k-1}\\)，首项8、公比-4。所求和为 \\(\\sum_{k=1}^nb_k=8\\dfrac{1-(-4)^n}{1-(-4)}=\\dfrac85[1-(-4)^n]\\)。"
   }
